        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_3754_15091.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>An Obervogt <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-502" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Aman</orgName> und <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-864" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gricht</unclear></orgName>
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Daegersweilen</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruendt</unclear>- <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbarlich</unclear> willig dienst <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuovor</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wohl</unclear>-
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">edler</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gestrenger</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besonders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guenstiger</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Herr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">OberVogt</unclear>,
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehrsamer</unclear> und Weise, besonders liebe guete Fruend
<lb n="6"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nachbarn</unclear>.
<lb n="7"/>Was an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebohrnne</unclear> burgerin, die Tugendt-
<lb n="8"/>samme frauw <persName resp="#ner">Benigna Zuecherin</persName>, weilandt unsers ge-
<lb n="9"/>weßtnen burgers <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hauptmanns</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sebastians</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Kuenzlerß</unclear></persName>, und
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anjeczo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Herren</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Johann</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Leonhardt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mschelisß</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Pfarherns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear>
<lb n="11"/><placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lußdorff</unclear></placeName> und Decani deß <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-29" cert="medium" resp="#ner">frauwenfeldischen</placeName> Capitulß,
<lb n="12"/>ehliche hußfrauw gehorsamb gelangen laßen, und sowol
<lb n="13"/>umb Attestationales als <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Intercessionales</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">denstfleißig</unclear>
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebetten</unclear>, das beliebe denselben uß dem Einschluß mit
<lb n="15"/>mehrem zuovernemmen.
<lb n="16"/>Wann dann wir die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wahrheit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuobefuerderen</unclear>, deßgleichen auch
<lb n="17"/>die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gerechtigkeit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuobefuerdern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">je</unclear> allweg so willig
<lb n="18"/>alß pflichtig befinden, So habend wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jhro</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Supplicantin</unclear> in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jhrem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">billichmeßigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begehren</unclear> nicht zu-
<lb n="20"/>wider noch entkegen sein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">koennen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">noch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soellen</unclear>.
<lb n="21"/>Und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">berichtend</unclear> hiemit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehrs</unclear>. und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Euch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lieb</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nachbarn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiemit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrlichen</unclear>, daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrewer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lieber</unclear>
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mitraht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hauptmann</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fridrich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Buchser</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bezueget</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear>
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nicht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obbemelter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frauw</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Benigna</unclear>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zuecherin</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wehrendem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jhrem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehestandt</unclear>, und weilen
<lb n="26"/>zuo allen fuerfallenheiten
<lb n="27"/>ein solches deßgleichen in Jhrem Wittibensstandt zu Vogt
<lb n="28"/>trewlich aengenommen, nach dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jhr</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Emann</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">s</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kriegsdienst</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begeben</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uß</unclear>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsrer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Oberkeitlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verordnung</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sebastian</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Kuentz</unclear>-
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lerß</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seins</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bohlseligen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">all</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haab</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guot</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">durchgehendt</unclear>,
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrachtet</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sowol</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> auch die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Kinder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">samb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jhr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoge</unclear>-
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bracht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haab</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guot</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versichert</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bester</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">maßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versorgt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werde</unclear>,
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beholffen</unclear>,
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">maßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußert</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ordenlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uffzechnung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nicht</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bschehen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seye</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obbemelte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hunder</unclear>-
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laßene</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wittib</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jenigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehetaedichß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guldinen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">welche</unclear>
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jhr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorfahrin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frauw</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Margaretha</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Meyerin</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jhrn</unclear>
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beiden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Toechtern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Erster</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehe</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermacht</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear>
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guot</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Castell</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versichert</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waren</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hette</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bezahlten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sollen</unclear>,
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beid</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Toechtern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jhr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dafelben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Erbeigenthumblich</unclear>
<lb n="42"/>mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gwisen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bedingung</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eigenthumblich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verfolget</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seye</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear>
<lb n="43"/><origDate when="1647-08-17" resp="#ner">17. Augusti. 1647</origDate>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_3754_15092.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="44"/>sampt ihrer tochter in die dreyhundert gulden weniger dann nichts ge=
<lb n="45"/>habt hettend.
<lb n="46"/>Gelangt demnach an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Euw</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">V</unclear>. und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehrs</unclear>. und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Euch</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear>
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lieb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nachbarn</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freuendt</unclear>- <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbarlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersuchen</unclear>
<lb n="48"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bitten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geruhend</unclear>, in betrachtung deßen, die=
<lb n="49"/>se ehrliche matron und ihren ehrvogt in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bester</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">recom=</unclear>
<lb n="50"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mendation</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuhalten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihnen</unclear> nicht aufzulegen, daß
<lb n="51"/>sie dem <persName resp="#ner">Casimirn Roggwiler</persName>, an seiner an weiland
<lb n="52"/><persName resp="#ner">Sebastian Kueenen</persName> s. habenden deß hauses und leedersach
<lb n="53"/>halben (sintemahln, wie gehört, sein kueenisch gut
<lb n="54"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nicht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhanden</unclear>) etwas bezahlen solle, vil weniger sie
<lb n="55"/>zue abstattung der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unndten</unclear> (<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ansehung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sie</unclear> von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear>
<lb n="56"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gegentheil</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ungueetlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umbgefuehrt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getriben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">worden</unclear>)
<lb n="57"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angehalten</unclear> werden.
<lb n="58"/>Solches umb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vst</unclear>. und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehrs</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Euch</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> lieb Nachparn,
<lb n="59"/>in dergleichen und andern weg hinwiderumb freuendt-
<lb n="60"/>nachbarlich zubeschulden, sind wir so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">willig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anerbietig</unclear>.
<lb n="61"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gottes</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnaediger</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auffsicht</unclear> uns zumahl wohl be=
<lb n="62"/>fehlende. Datum den <origDate when="1647-08-17" resp="#ner">17. Augusti Ao. 1647</origDate>.
<lb n="63"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und Raht
<lb n="64"/>der Statt Sant Gallen</orgName>.
<lb n="65"/>Dem Wohledlen und Gestrrengen hern N. N.
<lb n="66"/>Fuerstl. Bischoffl. Costanzschen Raht und Ober=
<lb n="67"/>vogt, deßgleichen den Ehrsamen und Weisen, Am=
<lb n="68"/>man und Gricht zue <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-5" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Arbon</placeName>, unserm besonders
<lb n="69"/>guenstigen hern, auch lieben gueten Freuenden und
<lb n="70"/>Nachbarn.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_3754_15093.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_3754_15094.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="71"/>An vogt <persName role="recipient" resp="#ner">Cuontz</persName> und gricht zu
<lb n="72"/><placeName resp="#ner">Dägersweihlen</placeName>. 1647. <origDate resp="#ner">17. Aug</origDate>
</p>
